                "`#{Syntax.MARKER_ROOT}` must mark a bare-read parameter",
                "dot-call syntax never hides write access or a move behind the receiver",
                "remove {Syntax.WRITE_ACCESS_LABEL} or {Syntax.MOVE_MARKER_LABEL} from the `#{Syntax.MARKER_ROOT}` parameter", Val(p.name_span)))
